## Don't-Drag-Names Guard (when porting setup from another project)

- Read prior-project files as structural templates only.
- Strip every literal name, path, port, service name, brand, person name, vault path from a prior project.
- If you find yourself about to write a literal prior-project name into a file in this repo, stop.
